- Fix Codex, Gemini, Anthropic, SysOM, DeepSeek and Responses parsing and usage gaps
- Isolate concurrent storage writes and bound LLM HTTP request attempts
- Harden batch exports, RSS evidence, recovery replay and benchmark campaigns
- Keep enforcer objects within the eBPF verifier stack limit
- Migrate configuration to schema 6 with a timestamped backup

